<main class="solution-page">
  <section class="solution-hero">
    <p class="v2-eyebrow">{{ solution.label }}</p>
    <h1>{{ solution.headline }}</h1>
    <p class="solution-lede">{{ solution.description }}</p>
    <a class="btn-lime" href="/contact/?solution={{ solution.slug }}" data-track="cta_growth_plan" data-track-label="{{ solution.slug }}">{{ solution.cta }} <span class="arr">↗</span></a>
  </section>
  <section class="solution-fit"><div><p class="v2-eyebrow">Who this is for</p><h2>{{ solution.audience }}</h2></div><div><p class="v2-eyebrow">Typical situations</p><ul>{% for item in solution.situations %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div></section>
  <section class="solution-problem"><div><p class="v2-eyebrow">The business problem</p><h2>{{ solution.problem }}</h2></div><p>{{ solution.outcome }}</p></section>
  <section class="solution-components"><p class="v2-eyebrow">What we build</p><h2>A system with the right moving parts.</h2><div class="solution-component-grid">{% for item in solution.components %}<article><span>0{{ loop.index }}</span><h3>{{ item }}</h3></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
  <section class="solution-framework"><p class="v2-eyebrow">How we build it</p><h2>{{ solution.processHeading }}</h2><div>{% for item in solution.process %}<article><span>0{{ loop.index }}</span><h3>{{ item.title }}</h3><p>{{ item.description }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
  <section class="solution-approach"><div><p class="v2-eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>One team, accountable for the full picture.</h2></div><ol><li>Understand the business, category and growth constraint.</li><li>Build the strategy and the system around the objective.</li><li>Execute, measure and improve with one integrated team.</li></ol></section>
  <section class="solution-relevance"><div><p class="v2-eyebrow">Relevant contexts</p><h2>Built for growth problems, not a narrow service category.</h2><p>See the full portfolio of verified ScratchBox work while individual case-study pages are being developed.</p><a class="btn-ink" href="/work/">See Our Work <span class="arr">↗</span></a></div><div><p class="v2-eyebrow">Capabilities deployed</p>{% for item in solution.capabilityLinks %}<a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.label }} <span>→</span></a>{% endfor %}<p class="v2-eyebrow solution-relevance-label">Relevant industries</p>{% for item in solution.industries %}<a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.label }} <span>→</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></section>
  <section class="solution-measurement"><div><p class="v2-eyebrow">Measurement approach</p><h2>We agree on the signals that matter before we call the work successful.</h2></div><p>That may mean clarity of positioning, quality of demand, conversion behaviour, launch momentum, operating consistency or another commercially relevant measure. The scorecard follows the objective — not a generic vanity-metric report.</p></section>
  <section class="solution-faq"><p class="v2-eyebrow">Questions before we begin</p><div class="solution-faq-grid"><article><h3>Is this a fixed package?</h3><p>No. The system is scoped around your business objective, complexity and current maturity.</p></article><article><h3>Can we start with one focused objective?</h3><p>Yes. A defined brand, launch or growth constraint is often the right starting point.</p></article><article><h3>What happens after the Growth Plan?</h3><p>We review the context, identify the right engagement shape and decide whether there is a strong fit to work together.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="solution-cta"><p class="v2-eyebrow">A focused conversation</p><h2>{{ solution.cta }}</h2><p>{{ solution.price }}</p><a class="btn-lime" href="/contact/?solution={{ solution.slug }}" data-track="cta_growth_plan" data-track-label="{{ solution.slug }}-bottom">Get My Growth Plan <span class="arr">↗</span></a></section>
</main>
{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
